(6885614, 1037660, 94134, '<td valign="top">BRAVO! Great job. I love his photo so much. The location, the quaint jungle lighting and their wardrobe.  Such a great set up I hope it wins.</td>', 'BRAVO! Great job. I love his photo so much. The location, the quaint jungle lighting and their wardrobe.  Such a great set up I hope it wins.', '2012-10-18 15:47:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(6885706, 1037758, 61396, '<td valign="top">there is stuff in here</td>', 'there is stuff in here', '2012-10-18 19:48:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(6885731, 1037572, 10785, '<td valign="top">Background is everything... The cars are very distracting and kill the emotional appeal of the image. The solution to this is to either change the DoF to blur the background or rotate your position to eliminate the clutter. But a great quote from the movie none the less!!</td>', 'Background is everything... The cars are very distracting and kill the emotional appeal of the image. The solution to this is to either change the DoF to blur the background or rotate your position to eliminate the clutter. But a great quote from the movie none the less!!', '2012-10-18 21:08:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(6885733, 1037643, 10785, '<td valign="top">In this shot, the composition could be improved dramatically by using the rule of thirds more precisely, framing the shot so there is less head room and adjusting your viewpoint by getting down low and shooting the child from his vantage point. It looks as though you are shooting above him looking down. And with him looking up, it makes the child seem insignificant when in fact he is the star of the shot.</td>', 'In this shot, the composition could be improved dramatically by using the rule of thirds more precisely, framing the shot so there is less head room and adjusting your viewpoint by getting down low and shooting the child from his vantage point. It looks as though you are shooting above him looking down. And with him looking up, it makes the child seem insignificant when in fact he is the star of the shot.', '2012-10-18 21:16:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(6885737, 1037500, 10785, '<td valign="top">I think the composition is nice and the exposure and post processing are good, but the weather is not cooperating with you. The overcast day makes the lighting lacking in contrast. You shot it well, but with no real good shadows or dramatic side lighting, this is a lackluster landscape in green, tan and grey.</td>', 'I think the composition is nice and the exposure and post processing are good, but the weather is not cooperating with you. The overcast day makes the lighting lacking in contrast. You shot it well, but with no real good shadows or dramatic side lighting, this is a lackluster landscape in green, tan and grey.', '2012-10-18 21:18:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(6885738, 1037502, 10785, '<td valign="top">There is no real focal point in the shot and the focus or sharpness of the shot is off.</td>', 'There is no real focal point in the shot and the focus or sharpness of the shot is off.', '2012-10-18 21:19:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(6885742, 1037079, 10785, '<td valign="top">I''m liking the PP, both the grain and tones are nicely done. There is an interest in the photo with the people in the cross walk but looking at their backs doesn''t really invite a connection or that elusive <u>Decisive Moment</u> of street photograpy necessity.</td>', 'I''m liking the PP, both the grain and tones are nicely done. There is an interest in the photo with the people in the cross walk but looking at their backs doesn''t really invite a connection or that elusive Decisive Moment of street photograpy necessity.', '2012-10-18 21:43:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(6885743, 1037378, 10785, '<td valign="top">The big, blue, blown blob at the top of the building kills this.</td>', 'The big, blue, blown blob at the top of the building kills this.', '2012-10-18 21:47:59.000000', NULL, 1),
