(6890031, 1037660, 138630, '<td valign="top">Absolutely gorgeous photo with a beautiful couple and equally lovely lighting.  The color is stunning, too.  Congratulations on the ribbon, Judi.</td>', 'Absolutely gorgeous photo with a beautiful couple and equally lovely lighting.  The color is stunning, too.  Congratulations on the ribbon, Judi.', '2012-10-24 11:41:55.000000', NULL, 0),
(6890032, 1037732, 47316, '<td valign="top">I find it funny not many comments on this one, myself included. I was one of your 10s and I''m not even sure why. I think that''s a good thing. I just was going through images I found pretty lackluster and then this one boom! Like a punch in the gut I felt compelled to give it a 10. I even tried to understand why after and the only thing I thought was "That road is a pretty straight line" but really looking at it, it''s not that straight. As nam said before me, it just pulls you in I guess!</td>', 'I find it funny not many comments on this one, myself included. I was one of your 10s and I''m not even sure why. I think that''s a good thing. I just was going through images I found pretty lackluster and then this one boom! Like a punch in the gut I felt compelled to give it a 10. I even tried to understand why after and the only thing I thought was "That road is a pretty straight line" but really looking at it, it''s not that straight. As nam said before me, it just pulls you in I guess!', '2012-10-24 11:43:13.000000', NULL, 0),
